<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Cock vore (bladder)-->
  <CockBladderConvertUrine.RMBLabel>公鸡吃人(膀胱)</CockBladderConvertUrine.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Bladder urifaction is where the predator shunts the prey into whichever genital is chosen and into their kidney for conversion into urine, which can be a fertilizer component. This does not feed the predator.-->
  <CockBladderConvertUrine.description>膀胱分裂是捕食者将猎物分流到选择的任何一个生殖器官，并注入肾脏，转化为尿液，这可能是肥料的成分。这不会喂养捕食者。</CockBladderConvertUrine.description>
  <!--EN: (Urify) Cock-->
  <CockBladderConvertUrine.label>(Urify) 公鸡</CockBladderConvertUrine.label>
  <!--EN: Cock vore-->
  <CockConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>公鸡吃人</CockConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Cock olifaction is where the predator shunts the prey down their cock and into their balls for conversion into chemfuel, like a boomalope. This does not feed the predator and requires the installation of a vore enabler.-->
  <CockConvertChemfuel.description>公鸡政治活动是指捕食者像爆炸羊一样，将猎物分流到它们的公鸡和球里，然后转化为化合燃料。这不会喂养捕食者，并且需要安装吃人使能者。</CockConvertChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: (Olify) Cock-->
  <CockConvertChemfuel.label>(Olify) 公鸡</CockConvertChemfuel.label>
  <!--EN: Nipple vore-->
  <NippleConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>乳头 吃人</NippleConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Nipple olifaction is where the predator shunts the prey through their nipple and into their mammary for conversion into chemfuel, like a boomalope. This does not feed the predator and requires the installation of a vore enabler.-->
  <NippleConvertChemfuel.description>乳头汲血是捕食者通过它们的乳头植入它们的乳房中，像爆炸羊一样转化为化合燃料。这不会喂养捕食者，并且需要安装吃人使能者。</NippleConvertChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: (Olify) Nipple-->
  <NippleConvertChemfuel.label>(Olify)乳头</NippleConvertChemfuel.label>
  <!--EN: Udder vore-->
  <UdderConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>乳房吃人</UdderConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Udder olifaction is where the predator shunts the prey through theirteat and into their udder for conversion into chemfuel, like a boomalope. This does not feed the predator and requires the installation of a vore enabler.-->
  <UdderConvertChemfuel.description>Udder oliction 是指捕食者像爆炸羊一样，通过它们的奶头将猎物分流到 udder 里，转化为化合燃料。这不会喂养捕食者，并且需要安装吃人使能者。</UdderConvertChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: (Olify) Udder-->
  <UdderConvertChemfuel.label>(Olify) 乳房</UdderConvertChemfuel.label>
  <!--EN: Udder vore-->
  <UdderConvertMilk.RMBLabel>乳房吃人</UdderConvertMilk.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Udder lactifaction is where the predator shoves the prey through their teat and into their udder for conversion into nutritious consumable milk. This process itself does not feed the predator.-->
  <UdderConvertMilk.description>乳房吸引是指捕食者将猎物塞进乳房，转化为营养消耗产物。这个过程本身不会喂养捕食者。</UdderConvertMilk.description>
  <!--EN: (Lactify) Udder-->
  <UdderConvertMilk.label>(Lactify) 乳房</UdderConvertMilk.label>
  <!--EN: Vaginal vore (bladder)-->
  <VaginalBladderConvertUrine.RMBLabel>vaginalvore(膀胱)</VaginalBladderConvertUrine.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Bladder urifaction is where the predator shunts the prey into whichever genital is chosen and into their kidney for conversion into urine, which can be a fertilizer component. This does not feed the predator.-->
  <VaginalBladderConvertUrine.description>膀胱分裂是捕食者将猎物分流到选择的任何一个生殖器官，并注入肾脏，转化为尿液，这可能是肥料的成分。这不会喂养捕食者。</VaginalBladderConvertUrine.description>
  <!--EN: (Urify) Vaginal-->
  <VaginalBladderConvertUrine.label>(Urify)阴道</VaginalBladderConvertUrine.label>
  <!--EN: Vaginal vore-->
  <VaginalConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>阴道 吃人</VaginalConvertChemfuel.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Vaginal olifaction is where the predator unbirths the prey into their womb for conversion into chemfuel, like a boomalope. This does not feed the predator and requires the installation of a vore enabler.-->
  <VaginalConvertChemfuel.description>阴道政治活动是指捕食者将猎物像爆炸羊一样取出并植入子宫，转化为化合燃料。这不会喂养捕食者，并且需要安装吃人使能者。</VaginalConvertChemfuel.description>
  <!--EN: (Olify) Vaginal-->
  <VaginalConvertChemfuel.label>(Olify)阴道</VaginalConvertChemfuel.label>
  <!--EN: Vaginal vore-->
  <VaginalConvertEggs.RMBLabel>阴道 吃人</VaginalConvertEggs.RMBLabel>
  <!--EN: Vaginal ovifaction is where the predator unbirths the prey into their ovary for conversion into eggs. This does not feed the predator and requires the installation of a vore enabler.-->
  <VaginalConvertEggs.description>阴道产卵是指捕食者将猎物取出并植入其卵巢，转化为卵。这不会喂养捕食者，并且需要安装吃人使能者。</VaginalConvertEggs.description>
  <!--EN: (Ovify) Vaginal-->
  <VaginalConvertEggs.label>(卵生)阴道</VaginalConvertEggs.label>
</LanguageData>
